WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:01.935
-This is very exciting.

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:05.472
I keep forgetting
to mention this,

00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:07.640
but the NBA Finals
are going on right now.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.275
I'm a Boston Celtics fan.

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:12.278
My dear friend Andy Samberg
is Golden State Warriors fan.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:14.547
We made a bet at
the beginning of the Finals,

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:20.153
which is whoever won would write
something about my dog Frisbee

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:23.022
that the other one
would have to read on camera.

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:26.025
The reason this is interesting
and the stakes are high

00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:28.761
is that Andy Samberg
hates my dog Frisbee

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:32.565
and often says
that she looks like a rat.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:35.602
In his defense, that's because
he's a terrible person.

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:40.073
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:44.244
So if you weren't invested
in the NBA Finals, you are now!

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:47.380
The NBA Finals only on NBC.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:48.714
What was that? Oh, okay.

00:00:48.714 --> 00:00:49.782
Well, I shouldn't have said that
then.

00:00:49.782 --> 00:00:52.385
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:53.753
ESPN and ABC? Okay.

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:56.122
[ Laughter ]

